Design standards (must follow):
- Use AppTheme colors ONLY (no random colors)
- Spacing: 8/12/16/20/24pt (AppTheme constants)
- Typography: System fonts with proper weights
- Touch targets: Minimum 44pt, recommended 48pt
- Animations: <400ms, spring or easeInOut
- NO bright colors (pink, purple, orange)
- NO cluttered layouts
- Professional, sleek, modern (YouTube-level)